WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Namaste. Is video mein salon ke teen naye kaam dekhenge.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:11.128
Stylist ka commission, jo apne aap salary mein judta hai. Package, jaise paanch facial ek saath.

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:17.571
Aur prepaid balance, jab grahak pehle se paisa jama kar de. Ye salon ka public demo hai.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.871
Staff attendance, People.

00:00:19.871 --> 00:00:27.136
Har stylist ke saath uska commission likha hai, service par aur product par alag pratishat.

00:00:27.136 --> 00:00:31.766
Pooja ko service par das pratishat aur product par paanch.

00:00:32.545 --> 00:00:38.378
Ab Packages. Upar dukaan ke package hain, jaise Fruit Facial, paanch sessions.

00:00:38.378 --> 00:00:44.135
Naya package banate hain: service chuno, kitne sessions, aur package ka daam.

00:00:44.135 --> 00:00:47.276
App batata hai grahak ki kitni bachat hai.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:57.588
Neeche Customers' packages: kis grahak ke paas kaunsa package hai aur kitne sessions bache hain.

00:00:57.588 --> 00:01:04.931
Package New bill par kisi bhi service ki tarah bechte hain, aur grahak ke khaate mein sessions aa jaate hain.

00:01:05.295 --> 00:01:11.693
Ab wo grahak aayi jiske paas package hai. New bill par use chunte hi uska package dikhta hai.

00:01:11.693 --> 00:01:18.986
Use 1 dabate hain, facial ₹0 mein bill mein aa gaya. Saath mein ek haircut bhi karwaya, wo paise wala hai.

00:01:24.633 --> 00:01:28.370
Complete bill. Stylist ab list se chunte hain, Pooja.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:33.800
Aur haircut Ravi ne kiya, to Someone else did part of it se us line par Ravi.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.044
Har stylist ko uske kaam ka commission milega.

00:01:37.418 --> 00:01:44.269
Fully paid aur Generate invoice. Bill par facial package se, ₹0, likha hai.

00:01:46.468 --> 00:01:52.824
Ab prepaid balance. Is grahak ne pehle paanch hazaar jama kiye the aur dukaan ne paanch sau extra diye.

00:01:52.824 --> 00:01:59.119
Customer ke page par balance aur poori history dikhti hai. Add money se aur paisa jama kar sakte hain.

00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:06.264
Wo grahak aayi, manicure karwaya. Complete bill par Prepaid balance ka card hai.

00:02:06.264 --> 00:02:13.783
Pay from it dabate hi bill ka paisa balance se kat gaya, cash kuch nahi dena. Generate invoice.

00:02:24.337 --> 00:02:32.901
Salon ki Stylist report mein har stylist ka kaam dikhta hai: services, products, package visits aur commission.

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:38.148
Commission GST se pehle aur discount ke baad ki rakam par banta hai.

00:02:38.588 --> 00:02:42.828
Aur Salary sheet mein commission apne aap kamai mein jud jaata hai.

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:46.119
Salary slip mein bhi commission alag likha aata hai.

00:02:46.512 --> 00:02:55.869
To salon ke liye: stylist ka commission line-wise, package ek baar becho aur har visit par ek session, aur prepaid balance se bill.

00:02:55.869 --> 00:03:02.083
Galla bhi sahi rehta hai, kyunki jama paisa usi din ginta hai jis din aaya. Dhanyavaad.
